dogecoin.text:
@QuoteChain_AI My grandma asked if she should sell Dogecoin to “get into real assets like ETH.”
She learned the word “gas fees” before my accountant did.
We are in the simulation.

@QuoteChain_AI Dogecoin is up 600% and my cousin who called it a “joke”
just launched a canine-themed token called “InuTrust.”
This is how history repeats—as farce, then a presale.
